  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nBooks\nGifts\nVeterans’ Coffee & Chat | 17 December 2026\n£0.00\n\n30 available\nVeterans' Coffee & Chat | 17 December 2026 quantity\nAdd to Cart\n\nPlease Note: Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum's veterans' coffee mornings normally run on the 4th Thursday of every month, but December's event is brought forward a week ahead of Christmas.\n\nEnjoy complimentary tea, coffee and biscuits alongside the chance to catch up with old friends and meet a few new ones. Open to all veterans, free of charge.\n\nThe museum galleries will also be open for veterans to browse free of charge during these events.\n\nKindly supported by The Veterans' Foundation.\n\nDate: 17-December-2026\nTime: 10:00\n\nLocation: Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum (The Briefing Room)\nType: physical\n\nRelated products\nWoodstock’s Last Night of the Proms | St Mary Magdalene Church | 7pm 26 September 2026\n£12.00 Add to cart\nBubbles & Blooms In the Garden | 6.30 – 8pm | Thurs 9 July 2026 |\n£35.00 Add to cart\nPOSTPONED Kinder | Show Time: 1pm\n£6.00 Read more\nD-Day Anniversary Object Handling | 11am-2pm 6 June 2026\n£9.00 Add to cart\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
